# Every runtime data artifact is local-only: audio, transcripts, summaries,
# mentions, cache, reports, research reports, mappings, external boundary
# records, stock lens, corpus snapshots, notes, and study guides. Ignore the
# whole tree instead of listing subdirectories, so a new artifact kind added
# later is covered by default rather than silently becoming committable.
data/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.codex/config.toml
config/*.local.yaml
/.specify/feature.json
config/llm_profiles.local.yaml
evals/**/raw/
.venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.pytest-tmp/
.tmp/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
# Local tooling lockfile; packaging source of truth is pyproject.toml (setuptools).
uv.lock
.playwright-mcp/
# Writer locks. A `.claim` is a transient dot-prefixed sibling of the artifact it
# guards and is meaningless outside the run that took it.
*.claim
# Per-session scratch handoffs at the repo root. The durable, reviewed handoff
# document is docs/agent-handoff.md.
/HANDOFF-*-SESSION.md

